   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1.000eb (V. Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Weapons with a Tech Rebuild</p>\n<p><em>Adds superconductive coils to charging mechanisms, speeding up power flow to electromagnets at the cost of overall projectile impact.</em></p>\n<p>The weapon’s Tech Rebuild now only requires sacrificing half of the user’s MOVE (round down) to be charged. This must be done before the user has used any MOVE in their Turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Internal Components).</em></p>"
